{"schemaVersion":1,"id":396,"sections":[{"id":"915001-OPENING","name":"第 1 战 · 开场","scripts":[20651],"start":0,"count":50},{"id":"915001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20670],"start":50,"count":33},{"id":"915001-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20671],"start":83,"count":33}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:1","scriptId":20651,"text":"死水会议室中——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:2","scriptId":20651,"text":"“从菲尼克斯那边得到了失踪钢舞姬的消息。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":746,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:3","scriptId":20651,"text":"“哦~线索终于来了吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":746,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:4","scriptId":20651,"text":"“是的，我们约定在后天出发。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":746,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:5","scriptId":20651,"text":"“那这次任务大概会花多长时间？我们好准备一下。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:6","scriptId":20651,"text":"“嗯，这个还真说不准，因为是找人……就先按一周来算吧？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:7","scriptId":20651,"text":"“一周差不多，我问过扎莉和伊达，这种任务如果耗费太多时间就划不来了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:8","scriptId":20651,"text":"“搜寻者的情报我们可以先阅览一下吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:9","scriptId":20651,"text":"“哦，对。这是这次要寻找的失踪者。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:10","scriptId":20651,"text":"维卡的问题提醒了我，于是便开始介绍关于失踪者的个人资料。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:11","scriptId":20651,"text":"失踪者名叫：安妮·沃佳诺娃，使用的舞装型号是A-44。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:12","scriptId":20651,"text":"毕业于伏龙芝军事学院，成绩不算突出，毕业以后主要在波罗的海周边执行防务任务。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:13","scriptId":20651,"text":"失踪发生在三个月前，安妮在执行巡逻任务，原本要同行的另一名钢舞姬临时请假，所以才由她独自巡逻。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:14","scriptId":20651,"text":"安妮失踪后展开过几轮搜索，但都是无功而返。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:15","scriptId":20651,"text":"“大概就这样，这是从特勤局那边获得的资料，里面还附有安妮的照片。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:16","scriptId":20651,"text":"“哇，长得很漂亮啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:17","scriptId":20651,"text":"“看上去和姐姐不同，应该不是很好动的类型。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":584,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:18","scriptId":20651,"text":"“佩妮，你这是什么意思……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":584,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:19","scriptId":20651,"text":"“因为是单人行动才失踪，如果遭遇战车兽什么的……遇难也在所难免吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":572,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:20","scriptId":20651,"text":"“但周围长期都没有战车兽的袭击事件，寻找的时候也没有发现战斗的痕迹。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":572,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:21","scriptId":20651,"text":"“好了好了，再猜也没什么用，在菲尼克斯来之前，要去波西娅那边搞个搜索工具。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:22","scriptId":20651,"text":"“长官又让波西娅做什么新发明了？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:23","scriptId":20651,"text":"“具体得看波西娅，我也不知道。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:24","scriptId":20651,"text":"接着我们就去了波西娅的研究室。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:25","scriptId":20651,"text":"“唷，来了啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:26","scriptId":20651,"text":"“那个……前几天拜托你做的搜索机器怎么样了？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:27","scriptId":20651,"text":"“已经完成了，就在那儿。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:28","scriptId":20651,"text":"顺着波西娅指的方向，我们看到了一个机器人。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:29","scriptId":20651,"text":"“嗯？是机器人？我还以为是什么探索仪器呢？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:30","scriptId":20651,"text":"“怎么？你好像不满意？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:31","scriptId":20651,"text":"“不不，怎么敢。只是没想到会是机器人，出乎我的意料啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:32","scriptId":20651,"text":"“考虑到信息处理量会比较大，所以我就拿自律机器人改造了一下。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:33","scriptId":20651,"text":"“过来吧，救助者1号。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:34","scriptId":20651,"text":"随着波西娅的呼唤那个被称为救助者1号的机器人慢慢走了过来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1134,"speaker":"救助者1号","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:35","scriptId":20651,"text":"“有什么吩咐，主人。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":1134,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:36","scriptId":20651,"text":"“从现在开始你的最高指挥权转让给这个男人。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":1134,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:37","scriptId":20651,"text":"说着波西娅拍了拍我的肩膀。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":1134,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1134,"speaker":"救助者1号","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:38","scriptId":20651,"text":"“新的所有者追加，开始。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":1134,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:39","scriptId":20651,"text":"这个被称为救助者1号的机器人开始扫描我的身体。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":1134,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:40","scriptId":20651,"text":"“看上去挺智能的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:41","scriptId":20651,"text":"“那当然，你也不看看是谁造的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:42","scriptId":20651,"text":"“顺便你要的录音录像功能也已经加了进去。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:43","scriptId":20651,"text":"“谢了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:44","scriptId":20651,"text":"“不用谢我，我可是收了维多利亚的制作费，只不过是拿钱办事。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:45","scriptId":20651,"text":"“哦，这样的啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:46","scriptId":20651,"text":"“如果你这次顺利的话，我说不定就可以把这些机器人量产来大赚一笔。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:47","scriptId":20651,"text":"“那我们走吧，救助者1号。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1134,"speaker":"救助者1号","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:48","scriptId":20651,"text":"“跟随模式启动。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":1134,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:49","scriptId":20651,"text":"“别急着走啊……我还有件东西要给你。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-OPENING:20651:50","scriptId":20651,"text":"“？？？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:1","scriptId":20670,"text":"超距攻击发动之后，敌人的攻势变得非常薄弱，而且又回到了之前单一的攻击模式。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:2","scriptId":20670,"text":"我们开始准备撤离并寻找补给，但考虑到不能让安妮一个人留在那里，于是就只有我和佐伊返回了最近的中继站。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:4","scriptId":20670,"text":"中继站的联络室中——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:5","scriptId":20670,"text":"除了补给弹药之外，还通知了兰布达过来拿收集好的波谱坐标集。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:6","scriptId":20670,"text":"“嗯，这就是我要的东西。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:7","scriptId":20670,"text":"兰布达收起了波谱坐标集。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:8","scriptId":20670,"text":"“让我也看看～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":56,"right":608,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:9","scriptId":20670,"text":"只是没想到连波西娅也跟着来了……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":56,"right":608,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:10","scriptId":20670,"text":"“果然是柯西她们，你们要小心应对，她们可不像我这么好说话。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":56,"right":608,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:11","scriptId":20670,"text":"“是的……已经和她们交战过了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:12","scriptId":20670,"text":"“其实我也不太想暴力解决……你能不能帮个忙和她们交涉一下？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:13","scriptId":20670,"text":"“不要得寸进尺，我没有义务帮你们到这个地步。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:14","scriptId":20670,"text":"“也是……这次你已经帮了我们很多，不能让你太为难。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:15","scriptId":20670,"text":"“哼，知道就好。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:16","scriptId":20670,"text":"既然兰布达表示无法继续给与帮助，那只能按原计划进行。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:17","scriptId":20670,"text":"“那么波西娅，我们正好找你有事……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:18","scriptId":20670,"text":"这个时候波西娅不知道从哪里冒了出来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:19","scriptId":20670,"text":"“你们还没搞定吗？我看刚才超远距离火炮都发射了呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:20","scriptId":20670,"text":"“是啊……遇到了点麻烦。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:21","scriptId":20670,"text":"我们把情况也向波西娅解释了一下。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:22","scriptId":20670,"text":"“啊哈？坐标？那超距离火炮又可以派上用场了啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:23","scriptId":20670,"text":"“不过我需要整备一下。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:24","scriptId":20670,"text":"“希望能够快点。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:25","scriptId":20670,"text":"“作为测试费用的话，我会算你们便宜点的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:26","scriptId":20670,"text":"“那可真是太感谢了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:27","scriptId":20670,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:28","scriptId":20670,"text":"（我这么做真的好么？好像有点出卖柯西和奥米克戎的感觉……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:29","scriptId":20670,"text":"虽然兰布的这么想着，但是她还是根据约定把波谱坐标集中解析出的坐标公开了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:32","scriptId":20670,"text":"到达指定坐标——","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:33","scriptId":20670,"text":"这时候救助者1号开始闹腾了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1134,"speaker":"救助者1号","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:34","scriptId":20670,"text":"“发现超强力磁场，系统发生紊乱……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":1134,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:37","scriptId":20670,"text":"与此同时一轮炮击向我们袭来……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":1134,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":true},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-PROLOGUE:20670:38","scriptId":20670,"text":"“看来只能先打一场了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":421,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:1","scriptId":20671,"text":"“哼，这群猴子也想击溃我的磁力盾？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":421,"right":null,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:2","scriptId":20671,"text":"奥米克戎展开的磁力护盾，普通的炮击根本无法对据点造成损伤。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":421,"right":null,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":12,"speaker":"西格玛","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:3","scriptId":20671,"text":"“这……刚建好的据点就被发现了？怎么回事？？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":421,"right":12,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":430,"speaker":"柯西","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:4","scriptId":20671,"text":"“发生了点小状况。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":430,"right":12,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":421,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:5","scriptId":20671,"text":"“可能马上会有更猛的炮击过来，我的磁力盾应该可以挡住。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":421,"right":12,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":12,"speaker":"西格玛","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:6","scriptId":20671,"text":"“我才不管你们想怎么样，这个据点本来就是为了隐秘而设立的！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":421,"right":12,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":12,"speaker":"西格玛","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:7","scriptId":20671,"text":"“既然被发现了，那只能放弃这个据点了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":421,"right":12,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":421,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:8","scriptId":20671,"text":"“那我给你们争取点时间……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":421,"right":12,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:9","scriptId":20671,"text":"平时趾高气扬的奥米克戎也表现出了一丝愧疚。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":421,"right":12,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":12,"speaker":"西格玛","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:10","scriptId":20671,"text":"“柯西，过来帮我把东西运走。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":421,"right":12,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":430,"speaker":"柯西","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:11","scriptId":20671,"text":"“是。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":430,"right":12,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":430,"speaker":"柯西","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:12","scriptId":20671,"text":"（唉，又是体力活……）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":430,"right":12,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:13","scriptId":20671,"text":"由于波西娅的超距离火炮支援，我们顺利攻下了坐标据点。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":430,"right":12,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:14","scriptId":20671,"text":"但该据点已经人去楼空，柯西和奥米克戎她们都已经撤离。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":430,"right":12,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:15","scriptId":20671,"text":"“这个东西就是权令台座吧？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":12,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:16","scriptId":20671,"text":"因为不太懂旅行者的技术，所以又把兰布达给请来了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":12,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:17","scriptId":20671,"text":"“就是这个台座。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:18","scriptId":20671,"text":"这是一个竖立在地上的蓝色台座，上面浮现着这一区域的地图。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1135,"speaker":"安妮·沃佳诺娃","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:19","scriptId":20671,"text":"“唉？这个旅行者是……？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":1135,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:20","scriptId":20671,"text":"显然安妮被兰布达给吓到了，一下子不知道怎么办。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":1135,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:21","scriptId":20671,"text":"“让她把双手放上去。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:22","scriptId":20671,"text":"“安妮，相信我，把双手放在这上面。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1135,"speaker":"安妮·沃佳诺娃","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:23","scriptId":20671,"text":"“是。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":1135,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:24","scriptId":20671,"text":"安妮把手放在了蓝色台座上之后，兰布达对着蓝色的台座进行了一番操作。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":1135,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:25","scriptId":20671,"text":"“咔嚓”一声，安妮脖子上的迪塔格项圈掉落了下来。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":1135,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1136,"speaker":"安妮·沃佳诺娃","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:26","scriptId":20671,"text":"“终于解开了！！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":1136,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:27","scriptId":20671,"text":"“嗯，那么收工之前，先看看这里有没有什么值得带回去的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":1136,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:28","scriptId":20671,"text":"毕竟是旅行者的基地，自然少不了研究一番。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":1136,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:29","scriptId":20671,"text":"（在我这个旅行者面前搜刮旅行者的基地……感觉有点不舒服，可能是我累了……）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:30","scriptId":20671,"text":"委托顺利完成——成功救回了失踪钢舞姬并摧毁了一个旅行者的基地。（虽然最终并没有多大发现）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:32","scriptId":20671,"text":"众人离开后——","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1133,"speaker":"菲尼克斯","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:33","scriptId":20671,"text":"“死水的指挥官果然名不虚传，但和他在一起的那个旅行者是怎么回事……？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":null,"right":1133,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1133,"speaker":"菲尼克斯","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"915001-EPILOGUE:20671:34","scriptId":20671,"text":"“看来还得找点机会继续观察他……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":null,"right":1133,"section":2,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
